he end since Hawks is  already injured and exhausted he knows  full well that he is risking his life by  confronting all for one but he believes  that it's worth it if he can stall all  for one for long enough he might give  the heroes a UA a fighting chance  against shigaraki and even if Hawks has  to pay for this with his life he is  happy to pay the price Hawks has always  been the type of hero who knows what has  to be done and who is willing to do what  it takes if he has to take the life of  another or even give up his own life  Hawks is willing to make that sacrifice  and this is what makes him such an  interesting and memorable Hero at the  end of the previous chapter the big  final battle between Dobby and Endeavor  had just been and set up but before that  fight can really begin the latest  chapter moves us away from the battle on  gunga mountain and brings us back to  Deku shigaraki and the others at UA the  new chapter also continues with the  theme of the previous few chapters which  is the fact that the hero's strategy for  dividing the villains has failed the  villains managed to completely turn the  tables on the heroes and at this moment  they seem to have a decisive advantage  on the battlefield however there is one  tiny sliver of Hope left for Deku and  the heroes back at the UA we see the  newly opened portal that first appeared  at the end of chapter  374. izava sees present Mike and  kurogiri emerging from the portal and he  knows right away that this isn't good  moments later one of the twice clones  also emerges from the portal and rushes  at isawa monama and Manuel this clone  then begins to multiply and in a matter  of seconds the heroes are badly  outnumbered aizawa and manual attempt to  beat the Clones back but there are just  too many of them and the Clones managed  to tackle monama to the ground in that  moment monoma breaks eye contact with  shigaraki and then in the very next  moment a giant explosion rocks the UA  grounds those power poles that had been  keeping the UA afloat and the force  field in effect crumble into pieces and  suddenly the UA building begins losing  altitude with so much damage to the  power grid the UA can't stay afloat  anymore and so all the heroes and hero  students who have been giving it their  all to maintain the Integrity of the  floating UA are desperately trying to  figure out what to do now now there is  some confusion with the translations but  to me it seems like the sudden failure  of the UA system is the result of  Skeptics hacking effort at first I was  thinking that maybe shigaraki had used  some sort of explosive Quirk as soon as  monoma broke eye contact with him but  the chapter seems to be implying that  Skeptics hacking is at least partially  to blame for what's going on and not  only has skeptic been able to gain  control over the UA system but he has  also gained control over the underground  shelters where all the civilians are  still hiding needless to say things are  not looking very daijoubu for the heroes  but that is when the heroes find a small  Ray of Hope as the epic battle between  Deku and shigaraki escalates  shigaraki the real tomurashigaraki  suddenly reappears he sheds those  strange finger mutations from his body  almost like a snake shedding its skin  and he then returns to his normal slim  four by slim I mean he still has muscles  but he's not like this grotesque bulge  of different fingers that are all over  his body shigaraki then asks Deku why he  wanted to know whether he shigaraki was  still in there inside his own body he  tells Deku that his attempts to  communicate with him are pointless  because Deku is a hero and shigaraki is  his villain but this brief exchange  reveals a crucial piece of information  to Deku tomura shigaraki AKA tenko  shimura is indeed still there in fact  not only is he still there but he is  actually able to somehow regain control  from all for one and even though  shigaraki himself is certainly no Ally  to the heroes the fact that his  personality is able to return confirms  that all for one still hasn't managed to  gain complete control over his new  vessel the heroes still have a chance to  foil all for one's plans and prevent him  from turning shigaraki's body into the  perfect new vessel for himself that said  the path for bringing all for one down  is not going to be an easy one  especially since shigaraki himself is a  villain through and through even if the  heroes can prevent all for one from  taking over shigaraki's body they will  still have to defeat tomurashigaraki  himself that is challenging enough all  on its own but to make things worse Deku  is starting to feel the strain from  overusing his newest Quirk gear shift  he's feeling tired and he's worried that  if he doesn't let his body rest he soon  won't even have enough energy to breathe  on his own but the second user of one  for all and the original user of gear  shift seems to be telling Deku that they  can't quit just yet through the  mysterious connection between all for  one and one for all the second user  seems to confirm that all for one still  doesn't have the ability to control  shigaraki's body there is still a chance  that the heroes can take shigaraki out  before All For One turns him into a  perfect vessel for his own Evil  Personality but time is running out and  Deku has to move now there is no time to  rest or think things through it's time  to act as skeptic continues hacking and  interfering with the UA system he is  shocked to hear someone say found you  this voice is coming from one of his own  computer screens and it says that  finding skeptic was difficult but she  was still able to do it for gentle's  sake the final Page Reveals that best  girl La Brava is back only this time she  is not working against the authorities  she is working with them her  counter-attack against Skeptics hacking  is being actively supervised by  detective tsukauchi and that is how this  chapter ends and there are some big big  takeaways from this chapter that we  simply cannot ignore first the villains  are definitely winning right now and the  heroes are likely to take some serious  damage and maybe even suffer some  serious casualties that's because the  villains are just so freaking strong  right now they got Dobby going berserk  they got toga using Sad Man's parade  they got Primal for one and they got  shigaraki all of these guys are absolute  monsters and on top of that Deku is  running out of steam so we're about to  witness a very tough period for the  heroes the good news for the heroes is  that there is still time to stop all for  one from taking complete control of  shigaraki but with shigaraki now  presumably being able to use his quirks  again again and with Deku clearly tired  from using gear shift how are the heroes  going to stop shigaraki before all for  one arrives personally I really enjoyed  the return of La Brava she's a really  cool and memorable character and  bringing her in to virtually Flex on  skeptic was a great idea frankly I hope  we get to see more epic character  returns soon I've been waiting so long  to see stain fighting alongside Deku  against the villains I thought we were  gonna get that during deku's little  vigilante Arc but sadly we didn't I'm  still hoping that we will get to see  something like this in the future  because stain's character Arc clearly  isn't over yet and he still has a lot  that he could contribute to the story  but now let's talk about the secret  connection between all for one and one  for all and how this connection might  affect the final battle we know that all  for one was actually used to create one  for all in the first place and the two  quirks are originally belonged to Two  Brothers so there is clearly an  important connection between them but  the second user seems to be hinting at  an even closer connection and this is  something that we got a preview of  during the climax of The jakku Arc the  second user's Vestige seems to be able  to sense who is really in control of  shigaraki's body and of The Quirk all  for one itself this focus on the  connection between all for one and one  for all tells me that we are about to  see a showdown in the Vestige world at  some point in this final Arc while those  main fights continue to rage outside we  may also get an internal Battle of the  vestiges in the Vestige world that the  two quirks have created that is an  entirely new Battlefield that could be  introduced into the story very soon and  this Vestige Battlefield would feature  characters who have been long dead like  Nana and all the previous users of one  for all actively fighting against the  vestiges of all for one and shigaraki as  those guys attempt to steal one for all  from Deku this internal struggle will be  especially important given what we just  learned about Deku and how he's  struggling just to keep breathing after  seemingly overusing his newest Quirk  gear shift is Deku pushing himself too  far and is he actually tearing himself  apart from the inside because of his  desire to defeat the villains and  protect everyone is the connection  between all for one and one for all  going to get stronger during the final  fight which will allow both Deku and  shigaraki to access the Vestige world  and engage in battle on yet another  front how will the already exhausted  deck who deal with shigaraki who now  presumably has full access to all his  quirks once again will deku's body be  forced to evolve and attain Quirk  Singularity as I have theorized in the  past these are the big questions that I  am wondering about as we wait for the  next Shout after to drop happy New Years  everyone I appreciate you watching our  stuff and don't miss this other video  about how strong full power shigaraki  really is link is on screen right now  and down in the description

